<title>UK: Libya enters market to buy white sugar - traders.</title>
<headline>Libya enters market to buy white sugar - traders.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Libya is in the market to buy at least one cargo of white sugar, European traders said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Details were still sketchy and the requested shipment period was believed to be May.</p>
<p>While the buying tender was likely to be for one cargo Libya could take more if prices were attractive, they said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8064</p>
</text>
